item.tconstruct.arrow.desc=The Arrows are the ammo used for Tinkers' Bows. One stack provides many shots, and they can be modified as any tool.
item.tconstruct.battleaxe.desc=The Battleaxe is a heavy offensive weapon, bringing the berserker out. It is capable of bringing down small trees and can send foes flying.\nRight Click: Berserk
item.tconstruct.battlesign.desc=The Battlesign is the ultimate defensive weapon. An advance in weapon technology worthy of Zombie Pigmen everywhere.\nCan be used as a shield, reflects projectiles.
item.tconstruct.bolt.desc=The Bolts are the ammo used for Tinkers' Crossbows. One stack provides many shots, and they can be modified as any tool.\nPartially penetrates enemy armor.
item.tconstruct.broadsword.desc=The Broadsword is a universal weapon. Sweep attacks keep enemy hordes at bay.\nAlso good against cobwebs!
item.tconstruct.cleaver.desc=The Cleaver is a heavy offensive weapon. It has powerful strikes, but is difficult to wield.\nCleavers benefit from high damage.\nSlow, requires two hands!
item.tconstruct.crossbow.desc=The Crossbow is a slow but very powerful weapon. It has to be loaded beforehand by holding rightclick, but can be fired at any moment afterwards.\nUses Tinkers' Bolts.
item.tconstruct.excavator.desc=The Excavator is a broad digging tool. It digs up large areas of soil and snow in a wide range.\nTerraforming!
item.tconstruct.frypan.desc=The Frying Pan is a heavy weapon with knockback to create some distance. It also goes BOING!\nRight Click: Heavy Blow
item.tconstruct.hammer.desc=The Hammer is a broad mining tool. It harvests blocks in a wide range.\nAlso effective against undead.
item.tconstruct.hatchet.desc=The Hatchet chops up wood and makes short work of leaves. It also makes for a passable weapon.\nChop chop!
item.tconstruct.ingots.pigiron.tooltip=Oink!
item.tconstruct.kama.desc=The Kama is a precision reaping tool, mowing down plants and shearing animals.\nRight Click: Harvest and replant crops
item.tconstruct.longbow.desc=The Longbow is a powerful long range weapon. It provides high damage but is less mobile than its short brother.\nUses Tinkers' Arrows.
item.tconstruct.longsword.desc=The Longsword is an offensive weapon. It is often used for charging into battle at full speed.\nRight Click: Lunge
item.tconstruct.lumberaxe.desc=The Lumber Axe is a broad chopping tool. It can fell entire trees in one swoop or gather wood in a wide range.\nTimber!
