item.tconstruct.moms_spaghetti.tooltip1=§oI guess they're all right... but it's just not the same.\nThey definitely need some sauce, but it has to be red.
item.tconstruct.moms_spaghetti.tooltip2=§oSomething is missing.. could use some meat. Mama always used ALL the meat.\nI should get at least three different meat types.
